# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile (repo root). Keep the image build
# lean and prevent local secrets from leaking into build context.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/coverage
apps/api/src/generated
apps/mobile/*
!apps/mobile/package.json
apps/api/tests
apps/uploads
apps/digital-files/test-*
README.md
FEATURE-MAP.md
